Units -- units conversion and physical constants
************************************************

Description
===========

This package converts various units of measure to others.

Author
======

  * Daniel R. Grayson (see http://dangrayson.com/ ) <dan@math.uiuc.edu>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.9 of Units, released May 5, 2011.

